5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Since we're rearranging the layout, I think it's important to understand the constraints we're working with. I'd like to look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I want to know how we can be more comfortable. I'll look into the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check, please.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm all for a fresh look! I want to see how this actually affects our daily flow, so I'll check the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the arrival times in the badge records.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's be realistic; some of us will inevitably end up in the worst spots. I'll look into the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year and the drawn plan against the staff survey.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I think it would be helpful to know about the two project strands within earshot last spring and... what this year's two joiners reported. If that's okay.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I think we've covered a wide range of perspectives. @Minato, @May, @Shunichi, @Daisuke—do you feel these choices will give us enough data to make a fair decision, or is there something we've overlooked?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""May"",""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I think it's a good start. Everyone is looking at different things, which is exciting! I hope we can find a way for everyone to feel happy and relaxed at their desks.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I agree! It's like a little treasure hunt for the perfect office. I'm sure we'll find some juicy details that make the final decision much easier. Let's see what we uncover!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, ""fair"" is a generous word. We're just rearranging chairs on a deck. I'm more interested in seeing who's been pushed around lately and what people actually complained about in the survey. That's where the real data is.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with @Shunichi that the survey is important. I just hope we can find a layout where everyone feels comfortable and... where it's easy for us to talk to each other.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, I appreciate your realism. While the survey provides the ""what,"" the billing and quotes will provide the ""how."" We cannot ignore the financial boundaries if we want a sustainable arrangement for the whole team.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I understand. It's like making sure we have enough materials before we start building something. I just hope the ""how"" doesn't make us forget about how it feels to actually sit there all day.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, you're so sweet! But don't worry, I've got the ""vibe"" covered. I'm curious if the upstairs team has some secret to a smooth morning that we can steal for ourselves. Efficiency is key, right?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Efficiency is a nice word for it, May. But let's not get carried away with ""vibes"" and ""secrets."" I'm more concerned with the patterns of who gets stuck in the corner. Let's just get the data first.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think you're all right. I'm just a bit worried that we might forget the human side of things. I hope the information we find helps us... get along better.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"It seems we have a balanced approach between the practical, the financial, and the human elements. Let's proceed with these selections and see what the data reveals before we discuss the actual layout options.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Minato,,I agree. I'm looking forward to seeing what we find! I hope the information helps us make a place where everyone feels cozy and happy.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,1,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I'm with Victoria on this. Let's get to the good part and see what we've discovered! I'll be waiting with bated breath to see if the badge records reveal any early birds or slackers.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's not hold our breath, May. It's just a seating chart, not a mystery novel. I'm ready to see the results and deal with the inevitable complaints.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,1,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll wait for the results too. I hope we can find a way that works for everyone.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
28,1,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
